        "collapsible_tab_W7etYx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Specifications",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Available sizes: Queen (20\" x 30\"), King (20\" x 36\")</li><li>Dual-chamber design with two sides: Firm Wool and Plush Latex</li><li>One side filled with certified organic virgin wool, one side with shredded natural latex<br/>Organic cotton cover, soft and breathable against the skin</li><li>Naturally breathable and temperature regulating</li><li>Moisture-wicking for a drier sleep environment</li><li>Hypoallergenic and resistant to mold, mildew, and dust mites</li><li>Naturally flame resistant, no chemical retardants</li><li>Handcrafted in the USA</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 40,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 32,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_THr6Kx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Organic Wool (from sheep)</strong> — Certified organic, chemical-free virgin wool that regulates temperature, manages moisture, and naturally resists mold, mildew, dust mites, and flame. This is the firm, cooler side.</li><li><strong>Natural Latex (from trees)</strong> — Responsibly sourced shredded latex that's durable, breathable, and buoyant, adapting to your movement while holding consistent support. This is the plush, responsive side.</li><li><strong>Cover</strong> — Organic cotton for a soft, breathable feel against the skin.</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 0,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_wP3yAA": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you'll love it",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>One pillow, two feels: flip between Firm Wool and Plush Latex</li><li>Adjust to your night: firmer support or softer cushioning, no swapping pillows</li><li>Sleeps cool: breathable wool and latex stay temperature-neutral</li><li>100% chemical-free and organic, no off-gassing</li><li>Every pillow includes a free machine-washable protector</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0,
            "margin_top_mobile": 0,
            "margin_bottom_mobile": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_qCn4mP": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warranty & Returns",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Pillows may be returned within 30 days of delivery. Because the fill is adjustable and personal, we ask that the pillow and its protector are clean and undamaged. Stained or damaged items are not eligible for return. Confirm the current return window and any restocking fee at checkout.</p><p>Backed by Ultimate Snooze quality standards and handcrafted in the USA. For specific coverage terms on pillows, see our warranty page or contact support.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
